{"seq":2,"slug":"safety-stock-excess-stockout","title":"安全库存/超储/缺货并存诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout","wordCount":1888,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全库存-超储-缺货并存诊断\">安全库存/超储/缺货并存诊断</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存管理里最反直觉的现象是：<strong>同一个仓、同一个品类，既缺货又超储</strong>。不是统计口径错，而是「库存」不是标量——它是一组带位置的向量，安全库存的分配方式决定了超储与缺货能否同时存在。理解这一点的关键是把库存按<strong>缓冲角色</strong>拆开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>周期库存（cycle stock）</strong>：为满足两次补货之间的需求而持有，由批量决定。</li>\n<li><strong>安全库存（safety stock）</strong>：为吸收需求与提前期的不确定性而持有，由服务水平决定。</li>\n<li><strong>在途库存（pipeline stock）</strong>：已下订单未到货，是未来可用的承诺。</li>\n<li><strong>超储（excess）</strong>：超出「周期库存 + 安全库存 + 在途」的部分，即无对应需求计划的沉没资金。</li>\n<li><strong>缺货（stockout）</strong>：可售库存为零且有未满足需求的状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>缺货与超储并存有三个典型机制：<strong>SKU 间错配</strong>（A 品超储、B 品缺货，总金额超预算）、<strong>仓间错配</strong>（华东仓超储、华南仓缺货，总库存在合理区间）、<strong>时间错配</strong>（在途未到造成当前缺货，而到货后立刻变成超储）。诊断的核心任务是<strong>先判定是哪种错配</strong>，因为三者的处置完全不同。</p>\n<p>安全库存的定量基准见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_stock\">Safety stock</a>：「SS = zα × √(E(L)σD² + (E(D))²σL²)」，即同时考虑需求方差与提前期方差；在提前期确定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）时退化为「ROP = L·E(D) + zασD√L」。缺货超储并存的第一大来源就是这条公式被简化使用——只考虑需求波动、忽略提前期波动，在跨境（提前期本身波动巨大）场景下会系统性低估安全库存，于是缺货不断，而每次补货为了「保险」又超量，超储同步增长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[可售库存 Q] --&gt; B{对比 ROP}&#10;  B --&gt;|Q &lt; ROP| C[应触发补货]&#10;  B --&gt;|Q &gt;= ROP| D[不补货]&#10;  C --&gt; E{在途是否有未到货}&#10;  E --&gt;|有| F[时间错配&lt;br/&gt;等待在途]&#10;  E --&gt;|无| G[真缺货]&#10;  A --&gt; H{对比 SS + 周期库存}&#10;  H --&gt;|超出| I[超储候选]&#10;  I --&gt; J{超储与缺货是否同品类}&#10;  J --&gt;|不同 SKU| K[SKU 间错配]&#10;  J --&gt;|不同仓| L[仓间错配]&#10;  G --&gt; M[服务水平复盘]&#10;  M --&gt; N[检视 sigma_L 是否被忽略]\">graph TD\n  A[可售库存 Q] --&gt; B{对比 ROP}\n  B --&gt;|Q &lt; ROP| C[应触发补货]\n  B --&gt;|Q &gt;= ROP| D[不补货]\n  C --&gt; E{在途是否有未到货}\n  E --&gt;|有| F[时间错配&lt;br/&gt;等待在途]\n  E --&gt;|无| G[真缺货]\n  A --&gt; H{对比 SS + 周期库存}\n  H --&gt;|超出| I[超储候选]\n  I --&gt; J{超储与缺货是否同品类}\n  J --&gt;|不同 SKU| K[SKU 间错配]\n  J --&gt;|不同仓| L[仓间错配]\n  G --&gt; M[服务水平复盘]\n  M --&gt; N[检视 sigma_L 是否被忽略]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错配类型</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SKU 间错配</td>\n<td>品类金额正常，A 品超储 + B 品缺货</td>\n<td>预测结构误差、需求转移</td>\n<td>需求替代分析、结构调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓间错配</td>\n<td>总库存正常，仓间分布失衡</td>\n<td>分配规则静态、需求迁移</td>\n<td>仓间调拨、动态分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间错配</td>\n<td>在途未到 + 当前缺货</td>\n<td>提前期波动、在途未计入</td>\n<td>在途可视化、提前期建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务水平虚高</td>\n<td>缺货多但安全库存也高</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被忽略</td>\n<td>重估提前期方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量过大</td>\n<td>超储且周转慢</td>\n<td>EOQ 未考虑持有成本上升</td>\n<td>重算 EOQ / MOQ 谈判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"安全库存的正确计算\">安全库存的正确计算</h2><h3 id=\"需求方差与提前期方差必须分开估计\">需求方差与提前期方差必须分开估计</h3><p>按上文公式，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两个独立输入。绝大多数系统的错误是只维护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当常数。跨境场景下提前期的分布往往是<strong>右偏且长尾</strong>的：海运计划 35 天，实际 P50 = 38 天、P95 = 62 天。把均值 38 当确定值使用，会让安全库存低估一个数量级。</p>\n<p>正确做法是从<strong>收货事件</strong>反推提前期样本：每次采购记 <code>po_created_at</code> 与 <code>first_receipt_at</code>，按供应商×航线聚合出均值与标准差，并按 90/180 天滚动更新。这是安全库存从「拍脑袋」变成「可解释」的唯一路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"服务水平的合法取值\">服务水平的合法取值</h3><p>服务水平不能一刀切。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newsvendor_model\">Newsvendor model</a> 的临界分位，最优服务水平满足「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(q^{*})={\\frac {p-c}{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3355em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8544em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位缺货损失（或售价）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位成本。直观含义是：<strong>缺货损失越大、毛利越薄，越应该少备货</strong>；反之毛利厚、缺货代价高的品可以承受更高服务水平。这条公式把服务水平从「行业惯例 95%」变成「由经济性推导」。</p>\n<p>把这条逻辑接到 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/age-bucket-dio-turnover\">ABC-XYZ 分类</a>：AX 象限（高价值低波动）缺货损失大但可预测，服务水平可以给到 97%–98% 而不占太多货；AZ 象限（高价值高波动）即使服务水平的边际成本递增，也仍值得给高值，但要用更短补货周期来控制；CZ 象限应主动降到 85%–90%，让缺货换库存下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"循环库存与-eoq-的联动\">循环库存与 EOQ 的联动</h3><p>超储的另一个来源是批量子优化。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economic_order_quantity\">Economic order quantity</a>，总成本模型是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mi>Q</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=PD+K\\frac{D}{Q}+h\\frac{Q}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3534em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2694em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9244em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>」，最优批量「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;_&#x27; at position 4: Q^{_̲}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2…\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">Q^{_}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2DK}{h}}</span></span>」，前提假设包括「demand remains uniform throughout the period」与「holding cost is charged per unit per year」。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 被低估（只算仓租不算资金成本）时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 2: Q^̲_\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">Q^_</span></span> 会系统性偏大，直接制造超储。所以 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/inventory-carrying-cost-capital\">库存资金占用与持有成本</a> 算出的真实持有成本率，是 EOQ 能否用对的前置条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超储的量化口径\">超储的量化口径</h2><p>「超储」需要一个可计算的定义，否则永远争论。工程上采用<strong>覆盖期口径</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Excess</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>cover</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>in transit</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Excess} = \\max\\left(0,\\ Q - (D_{\\text{plan}} \\cdot H_{\\text{cover}} + SS + Q_{\\text{in transit}}\\right))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Excess</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{plan}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是计划期需求速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>cover</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{cover}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标覆盖期（天），再加安全库存与在途。这个定义的好处是<strong>显式暴露了「目标覆盖期」这个主观参数</strong>——它是品类策略的直接体现，不藏在公式里。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT s.sku_id, s.warehouse_id, s.on_hand_qty, s.in_transit_qty,&#10;         d.plan_daily_demand, ss.safety_stock_qty, p.cover_days&#10;  FROM inv_snapshot s&#10;  JOIN sku_demand_plan d USING (sku_id, warehouse_id)&#10;  JOIN sku_safety_stock ss USING (sku_id, warehouse_id)&#10;  JOIN sku_policy p USING (sku_id, warehouse_id)&#10;)&#10;SELECT sku_id, warehouse_id,&#10;       on_hand_qty, in_transit_qty, safety_stock_qty,&#10;       ROUND(plan_daily_demand * cover_days, 0) AS target_cycle_qty,&#10;       GREATEST(0,&#10;         on_hand_qty&#10;         - (plan_daily_demand * cover_days + safety_stock_qty + in_transit_qty)&#10;       ) AS excess_qty,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN on_hand_qty = 0 AND in_transit_qty = 0 THEN &#39;STOCKOUT&#39;&#10;         WHEN on_hand_qty = 0 AND in_transit_qty &gt; 0  THEN &#39;BACKORDER_WAIT&#39;&#10;         WHEN GREATEST(0, on_hand_qty&#10;              - (plan_daily_demand * cover_days + safety_stock_qty + in_transit_qty)) &gt; 0&#10;              THEN &#39;EXCESS&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;OK&#39;&#10;       END AS health_flag&#10;FROM base;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">warehouse_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on_hand_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">in_transit_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">plan_daily_demand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">safety_stock_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cover_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inv_snapshot s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_demand_plan d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, warehouse_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_safety_stock ss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, warehouse_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_policy p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, warehouse_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, warehouse_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       on_hand_qty, in_transit_qty, safety_stock_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(plan_daily_demand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cover_days, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_cycle_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         on_hand_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (plan_daily_demand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cover_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_stock_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit_qty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> excess_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_hand_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'STOCKOUT'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_hand_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BACKORDER_WAIT'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, on_hand_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (plan_daily_demand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cover_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_stock_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit_qty)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXCESS'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OK'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> health_flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并存诊断的三步法\">并存诊断的三步法</h2><h3 id=\"第一步-确认错配层级\">第一步：确认错配层级</h3><p>先做<strong>总量校验</strong>：品类总金额是否超预算？如果总额正常而内部一片红黄，就是结构错配；如果总额也超，就是系统性超储。这一步决定了后续是「调结构」还是「压总量」，动作差别巨大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二步-区分三种错配\">第二步：区分三种错配</h3><p>用上面的 <code>health_flag</code> 做交叉表：同一品类内 <code>EXCESS</code> 与 <code>STOCKOUT</code> 同时出现 → SKU 间错配；同一 SKU 在不同仓分别 <code>EXCESS</code> 与 <code>STOCKOUT</code> → 仓间错配；<code>BACKORDER_WAIT</code> 占比高 → 时间错配（提前期问题）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三步-根因归位\">第三步：根因归位</h3><ul>\n<li>SKU 间错配 → 需求预测的结构误差或需求替代，见 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a>。</li>\n<li>仓间错配 → 静态分配规则，处置在 <a href=\"onhand-intransit-multichannel-view\">在库+在途+多渠道合并视角</a> 的仓位视图与调拨建议。</li>\n<li>时间错配 → 提前期建模缺失，回到安全库存公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与健康度评分和告警的衔接\">与健康度评分和告警的衔接</h2><p>并存诊断的输出应直接进 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/health-score-redyellow-green\">库存健康度评分</a> 的服务维度：<strong>同一品类缺货与超储同时存在的天数占比</strong>，比单看可售率更能刻画健康问题——可售率会掩盖错配，因为超储的 SKU 拉高了可售率。这才是为什么健康度评分要设「可售率 + 呆滞金额占比」双维度，而不是单一的服务率。</p>\n<p>预警侧则要注意：<strong>缺货告警与超储告警必须能被同一个责任人看到</strong>。如果缺货归采购、超储归库存运营，两个团队各自优化，错配永不会消除。这也是 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/inventory-alert-owner-workflow\">库存预警推送与责任人闭环</a> 主张按「品类」而非「职能」归属责任人的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>库存按角色分为周期库存、安全库存、在途、超储；缺货与超储并存源自三者的分配失衡。</li>\n<li>安全库存公式「SS = zα × √(E(L)σD² + (E(D))²σL²)」必须保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 要从收货事件反推。</li>\n<li>服务水平应由 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">Newsvendor</a> 临界分位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{p-c}{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3355em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8544em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推导，不搞一刀切。</li>\n<li>EOQ 的持有成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 若低估会系统性制造超储，需用真实资金成本率。</li>\n<li>超储用覆盖期口径量化，显式暴露「目标覆盖期」这一策略参数。</li>\n<li>并存诊断三步：确认错配层级 → 区分 SKU 间/仓间/时间错配 → 根因归位。</li>\n<li>缺货与超储告警必须落到同一责任人，见 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/inventory-alert-owner-workflow\">库存预警推送与责任人闭环</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全库存/超储/缺货并存诊断","id":"安全库存-超储-缺货并存诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"安全库存的正确计算","id":"安全库存的正确计算"},{"level":3,"text":"需求方差与提前期方差必须分开估计","id":"需求方差与提前期方差必须分开估计"},{"level":3,"text":"服务水平的合法取值","id":"服务水平的合法取值"},{"level":3,"text":"循环库存与 EOQ 的联动","id":"循环库存与-eoq-的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"超储的量化口径","id":"超储的量化口径"},{"level":2,"text":"并存诊断的三步法","id":"并存诊断的三步法"},{"level":3,"text":"第一步：确认错配层级","id":"第一步-确认错配层级"},{"level":3,"text":"第二步：区分三种错配","id":"第二步-区分三种错配"},{"level":3,"text":"第三步：根因归位","id":"第三步-根因归位"},{"level":2,"text":"与健康度评分和告警的衔接","id":"与健康度评分和告警的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"呆滞/死库存识别规则与预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert"},"next":{"title":"在库+在途+多渠道合并视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/obsolete-excess-detect/onhand-intransit-multichannel-view"}}